{
	"name": "Regional Training",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/tools/navigation/map-simple-tree.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you improve your training by further specializing in your environment. You do not have to choose the same option as your chosen domain when you select from the following options:</p><p><strong>Desert:</strong> Your movement speed increases by 5ft.</p><p><strong>Forest:</strong> When making a ranged attack, you ignore concealment and cover from plants.</p><p><strong>Mountain:</strong> You benefit from half cover as three quarters cover and three quarters cover as total cover.</p><p><strong>Plains:</strong> When you make a melee weapon attack after moving at least 15ft, you gain an expertise die to the damage roll.</p><p><strong>Town:</strong> When moving through a dungeon, town, or other manufactured environment, you can move onto or over objects 5ft high or shorter, such as tables, low walls, or altars without expending additional movement or making any check.</p><p><strong>Wetland:</strong> When making a stealth check in areas of foliage, loose mud, or sand, you gain advantage through covering yourself in dirt and detritus.</p>",
